["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">砂</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すな</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">砂；沙粒；细砾</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"174298\"><ruby>後<rp>(</rp><rt>うし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ろ<ruby>足<rp>(</rp><rt>あし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>砂<rp>(</rp><rt>すな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をかけるようなことをした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He raised his heel against me.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">素直</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すなお</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">顺从；温顺；驯良；不做作；诚实；坦率；坦白；笔直；直顺；无特殊风格；无矫饰；标准；工整</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"201576\">どうしてあなたって<ruby>素直<rp>(</rp><rt>すなお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じゃないの？</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Why can&#x27;t you take things just as they are?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">すなわち</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">即；也就是说；换言之；正是；恰恰；不多不少；分毫不差；（〜ばすなわち）则；就；那么就（表示自然结果）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214578\">すなわち<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はそれをしたくないのだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">In other words, he doesn&#x27;t want to do it.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">すばしこい<