span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You will be able to ski well next year.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">スペース</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">空间；地方；（字母、单词等之间的）空格；间距；活字空铅；外层空间；宇宙空间</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224017\">このあたりは<ruby>駐車<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅうしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>できるスペースがほとんどない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">There are few places to park around here.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">スポーツ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">体育；运动</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197412\">ビリーはスポーツがうまいです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Billy is good at sports.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">スポーツカー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">跑车；运动型汽车</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234395\">あそこのスポーツカーを<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Look at the sports car over there.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">住まい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すまい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" hre