=\"en\">Why did he live in the United States?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">清む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（水、空气等）变清澈；变透明；（声音等）清脆响亮；清澈悦耳；变得平静；变得宁静；消除烦恼；发清音；读作清音</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143839\"><ruby>水<rp>(</rp><rt>みず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>底<rp>(</rp><rt>そこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まで<ruby>澄<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The water is clear to the bottom.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">済む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">完成；结束；完毕；结果比预期轻微；侥幸了事；感到安心；放心；因麻烦别人而感到抱歉；感到内疚</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"170302\"><ruby>済<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みません。<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してくれますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Excuse me. Can I get by here?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">澄む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（水、空气等）变清澈；变透明；（声音等）清脆响亮；清澈悦耳；变得平静；变得宁静；消除烦恼；发清音；读作清音</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143839\"><ruby>水<rp>(</rp><rt>みず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>底<rp>(</rp><rt>そこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まで<ruby>澄<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The water is clear to the bottom.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">天皇</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すめらぎ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">日本皇帝；日本天皇</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">相撲</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">すもう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">相扑；相扑选手；力士</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"140416\"><ruby>相撲<rp>(</rp><rt>すもう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たことがありますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Have you ever watched sumo wrestling?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">スライド</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">幻灯片；透明胶片；显微镜玻片；滑动；滑行；移位；挪动（如日程表中的项目）；（按滑动比例）变动；与…挂钩；指数化</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"113174\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はそのスライドを<ruby>顕微鏡<rp>(</rp><rt>けんびきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>た。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He looked at the slide under the microscope.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">スラックス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-m