/span></span><span class=\"v-m\">做；进行；执行；实施；使……成为；使……变成；把……变成；充当；担任；作为；起……的作用；穿；戴；做出（表情等）；判断为；视为；看作；当作；用作；决定；选择；被感觉到；被察觉到（气味、声音等）；处于；呈现；保持（某种状态、情况）；值……；花费；需要（若干费用）；经过；流逝（时间）；任命；提拔（至某职位或地位）；把……变成；使……成为；把……换成；利用；当作；视同；按……处理；对……感受到；对……有（某种感受）；动词化后缀；使名词变为动词；构成谦敬动词；用于以「お」或「ご」开头的名词后；即将；正要；企图；尝试</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"4858\">ログアウトするんじゃなかったよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I shouldn&#x27;t have logged off.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">刷る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">する</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">印刷；印制；用木模印染布料；印花</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">すると</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（然后）接着；随之；于是；这时；那么；那样的话；这样一来</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214097\">するとあなたは<ruby>幸<rp>(</rp><rt>しあわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せでしょう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Then you will be happy.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">鋭い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">するどい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">锋利的；尖锐的；（疼痛、声调等）剧烈的；尖锐的；（批评等）尖锐的；尖酸的；（攻击）猛烈的；（问题、目光等）犀利的；锐利的；（直觉、嗅觉等）敏锐的；灵敏的；（头脑等）敏锐的；机敏的；有洞察力的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224443\">ここに<ruby>鋭<rp>(</rp><rt>するど</rt><